[00:01.190]「Perfect Time」
[00:10.110]
[00:12.760]Vocal：Mika Kobayashi & mpi
[00:18.290]Lyrics：mpi
[00:24.480]Music：Hiroyuki Sawano
[00:31.420]
[00:32.970]Your tears and my fears are almost disappear
{"你的泪水与我的恐惧 都即将消逝"}
[00:36.710]So let's share the perfect time, For you and me
{"让我们共享完美时光 为你我而设"}
[00:41.890]You knocked on my door
{"你轻叩我的门扉"}
[00:43.460]So let's start our journey
{"让我们启程远行"}
[00:45.500]Because you came to see me first
{"因你率先寻我而来"}
[00:47.810]
[00:48.330]And Your loneliness and kindness are could be my trigger
{"你的孤独与温柔 都将成为我的契机"}
[00:53.380]So let's share the perfect time
{"让我们共享完美时光"}
[00:56.020]Can you grab both my arms and we'll jump out the window
{"能否紧握我双臂 一同跃出窗外"}
[01:00.280]Let's see what our future holds
{"看看未来为我们准备了什么"}
[01:02.990]
[01:03.660]There's no time
{"时不我待"}
[01:05.050]You can't ignore how your feel inside
{"你无法忽视内心的悸动"}
[01:08.420]I can't wait to see them all from my heart
{"我迫不及待想从心底见证一切"}
[01:12.800]Take my hand
{"握住我的手"}
